archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-02-19T05:04:06Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T10:06:48Z","closed_at":"2026-02-20T04:35:16Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.6.1.stable.official and v4.4.1.stable.official. I have not tested others.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200)  - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9159) - AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.15 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI expect that two exported variables with the same properties to behave the same in the Editor. But as seen in the screenshot, variable `compared` and `observed` that have the same properties don't behave the same way. `compared` is a proper Array exported variable, but `observed` is nil; clicking on it does nothing. `observed` was returned in `_get_property_list()`.\n\n<img width=\"1267\" height=\"848\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f558a182-a13c-435f-96bb-7431abcb39f2\" />\n\nCode:\n```gdscript\n@tool\nclass_name CustomProp\nextends Resource\n\n@export_tool_button(\"Get Properties\", \"Callable\") var prop_action = get_props\n\n@export var compared: Array[int]\n\nfunc _get_property_list():\n\tvar properties = []\n\t\n\tproperties.append({\n\t\t\"name\": \"observed\",\n\t\t\"type\": TYPE_ARRAY,\n\t\t\"hint\": PROPERTY_HINT_TYPE_STRING,\n\t\t\"hint_string\": \"%d:\" % [TYPE_INT],\n\t\t\"usage\": 4102,\n\t})\n\treturn properties\n\n\nfunc get_props():\n\tfor info in get_property_list():\n\t\tif info.name == \"compared\" or info.name == \"observed\":\n\t\t\tprint(info)\n\tnotify_property_list_changed()\n\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a new resource from CustomProp class script. That's it. Optionally, click on the \"Get Properties\" editor button to refresh property list and print out `compared` and `observed`  properties.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[custom_prop._mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25406034/custom_prop._mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"ssaenger","id":28540972,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NTQwOTcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28540972?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger","html_url":"https://github.com/ssaenger","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116466/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116466/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}